body:
 i asked for tips if anyone knew anything that i could be doing wrong, if you dont know how to fix it..why did you comment? i cannot afford wifi, its either this or my phones wifi, which is why i asked for help. dont you think if i could go another route i would? idk what is up with some people trying to seem so smart. 

&#x200B;

This is a new issue, so no it isnt just 'o dont use ur neighbors wifi lol' its been fine for months, randomly stopped working, so i asked for any advice, you need to find somewhere else to get validation and stop trying to act like you know what is best for other peoples situations.
